\nThey build you up with great story telling, great character development, world building and action and beyond.\n\nThey make you care about everything.\n\nAnd then they take it all away by telling you it was all meaningless and how that was the plan all along. Dumb and lazy and ultimately it cost this idiotic company a lot of money because fewer people wanted to have anything to do with your ultimately ♥♥♥♥ universe after that.\n\nThere's more hope and joy in the W40k universe and at least that universe doesn't pretend to be something it's not and the expectations are set up front. In ME all you work for is that in end you get to pick a color, Red, Blue, or Green. Dumb and lazy.", "timestamp_created": 1637777193, "timestamp_updated": 1637777193, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.45850178599357605", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103280767", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996848956", "personaname": "Siegkrieg", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Jeensin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 230, "playtime_forever": 124, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 124, "last_played": 1637598485, "avatar": "be458d103d784091f3d1e6eb6933eb6986a6af80"}, "language": "english", "review": "MASTERPIECE !!!! : 10 / 10 : A flawless masterpiece. An absolute must-play that delivers a legendary experience.", "timestamp_created": 1637598577, "timestamp_updated": 1788318329, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1032543